GIMP Palette
Name: TCP Licensed Pack Union
Columns: 5
#
# Licensed sprite pack palette for Tuna Control Protocol.
# Derived from mods/tcp_cats/sprites/ (21 colors) and mods/tcp_ferrets/sprites/ (8 colors).
# Union = 25 unique colors; 4 are shared between both packs.
#
# Grouped by material (highlight / base / shadow). Material numbers (M1..M11)
# match section 2 of .claude/rules/art-direction.md.
#
# Artist technique (SeethingSwarm, cross-pack analysis):
#   - Ramp is primarily V: each rung drops value by ~20-25%.
#   - Saturation creeps UP ~5% per rung as it darkens (shadows stay chromatic).
#   - Hue mostly static. Exceptions: M4 cool gray shifts toward purple in shadow;
#     M6 ferret pink shifts toward red in shadow.
#   - Low-S materials (below ~25% S base) keep S flat across the ramp.
#
# Aseprite: File > Palette > Load Palette > tcp-licensed.gpl
#
#
# Outline ramp (6) -- line work, not a surface material
#
  0   0   0	transparent (index 0)
 44  44  44	outline hi
 31  31  36	outline cool-dark
 22  22  22	outline mid
 19  19  24	outline shared (ferret)
 11  11  11	outline near-black
  0   0   0	outline base
#
# M1 Tabby tan -- saturated orange cat fur
# highlight shared with M2 and M5 (cream)
#
244 204 161	M1 hi cream
178 115  56	M1 base tan
103  68  35	M1 shadow
 60  41  26	M1 deep shadow
#
# M2 Muted warm brown -- neutral tabby body
# hi shares M1 cream
#
150 125 103	M2 base
109  75  57	M2 shadow
#
# M3 Cool gray fur -- gray or blue-point cat
#
203 219 252	M3 hi specular (also M9 lone)
143 155 169	M3 base
 84  93 103	M3 shadow
#
# M4 Cool structural gray -- body shadow / infrastructure metal
# shadow shares outline #131318
#
117 127 139	M4 hi
 73  76  84	M4 base
#
# M6 Ferret fur body -- pink-brown
#
190 175 167	M6 hi
148 122 117	M6 base (also M7 cross-pack mid)
 99  69  69	M6 shadow (also M7 cross-pack shadow)
 47  30  32	M6 deep shadow
#
# M7 Pink accent -- nose / inner ear / paw (cat only)
# mid and shadow borrow M6 ferret colors
#
189 136 121	M7 lone pink
#
# M8 Gold eye iris
# shadow shares M1 tan
#
255 211  79	M8 gold
#
# M10 Blood / crimson accent -- shared effect palette
#
169   0   0	M10 crimson
 87  37  59	M10 wine
